---
import SpatialField from './SpatialField.astro';
---
<section id="experience" class="experience wrap" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="section-kicker mono"><span>02 / LISTEN FROM THE INSIDE</span><span>A CHANGE IN PERSPECTIVE</span></div>
  <h2 id="experience-title" data-reveal>Not just a sound.<br /><em>A whole world around it.</em></h2>
  <div class="experience-layout">
    <div class="story-steps">
      <article class="story-step" data-step="0"><span class="step-index mono">01 — LOCATE</span><h3>Start with<br />a point of listening.</h3><p>A voice ahead. A signal above. An atmosphere all around. Position gives each element a role in the scene.</p></article>
      <article class="story-step" data-step="1"><span class="step-index mono">02 — RELATE</span><h3>The space between<br />changes the story.</h3><p>Bring the signal closer. Pull the atmosphere wide. See how each source relates to the listener and to the rest of the field.</p></article>
      <article class="story-step" data-step="2"><span class="step-index mono">03 — SHARE</span><h3>Find the same place.<br />Hear a new possibility.</h3><p>With a common point of reference, feedback can stay connected to the world you’re creating together.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="story-sticky"><div class="story-visual"><div class="field-heading mono"><span>SCENE STUDY / 001</span><span class="story-mode">01 — LOCATE</span></div><SpatialField variant="story"/><div class="story-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><p class="mono story-footnote">ILLUSTRATED SPATIAL RELATIONSHIPS · NO AUDIO PLAYBACK</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
